<title>USA: US DLA to offer tin monthly, ends daily sales.</title>
<headline>US DLA to offer tin monthly, ends daily sales.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said Wednesday it will end daily offerings for the sale of stockpiled tin and will instead offer tin once a month.</p>
<p>DLA said it expects to offer tin on the same day each month, but the date is yet to be determined.</p>
<p>September 30 was the final day for daily offers, DLA said.</p>
